			description: [
				"This book runs from your first fire to the dye works. Each quest says what to make and why it works, never how to build it. That part's yours."
				""
				"JEI has every recipe and the heat, speed or charge it needs. Ponder shows a block at work: hover over an item and hold W. Engineer's Goggles show what a placed block is doing."
				""
				"Item quests tick themselves off. If one doesn't, click the task."
			]
