			]
			description: [
				"Get a Furnace to &cSearing&r: Coal Coke or blaze rods in the firebox, or soul fire, a soul campfire or a fed Blaze Burner underneath."
				""
				"&cSearing&r is where iron, steel and brass begin. Goggles show a Furnace's exact heat, its fuel and what each slot is waiting for, and a comparator reads its heat."
